{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1221,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:906795f624f990088997f311",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢看见人因为惊喜，\r\n表情由惊讶变成笑容的瞬间。\r\n呵呵，真的会让人欲罢不能呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1209990c4282b7e549393428e0cbf62c77cdc14d7a73a0c712a7af4b5912b7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98b5430024b91a896fdd5af2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我几乎都是带给人惊喜的，\r\n但还是时常被速子给吓到呢……\r\n嗯～我可不能输给她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a08becdcecaf2e75f985919941818922306b39efe3971d11395609dd22b73481",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f40363483dacf035a2ed3a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然比赛和舞台表演，\r\n都是表现自己的地方……\r\n但你眼里看到的我是什么样子呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f81b0ddd0d24dd8b59b059561bc97b99a074f0d38b70986038f6cd9c6b9cdda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7c99065679f8d3069bd2276",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可爱的服装也不错，\r\n和我平时的感觉不一样，\r\n所以能让大家感到惊讶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dd4c05617fa75f8d7ae480af9ecc67a03f4e307fd6e271aab433113b96fb491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ce415fb629edd031819b82d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有些人称我为「黑色流星」。\r\n这套衣服就能呈现出\r\n适合这个称号的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "122ba28f43e1b83d66524103a6439fe5752a215a22aa938a2ae4c81c99e79c57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:028c4483f5425bb3dfc065f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得，如果是和你一起，\r\n我可以无止尽地一直向前奔跑。\r\n这就像是所谓的「奇迹」吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e28b24ef11edc9296f87f7737d9a833dafeafb320d18e1db224b77bdd9e3bb69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df13d48f3e1320ac45cf762",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很注重服装仪容。\r\n如果睡醒的时候发现头发翘起来，\r\n我就会利用它来设计造型！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7693195264a3ce14d09b287da71be4a5fd51777e752b77031981a393b11b2b50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05690387c39cea24a44b2d4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时间的食堂里，\r\n应该到处都是小马驹们吧。\r\n一定可以度过一段开心的午餐时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ca6e142646fa9182ff068bdb394fc845bfd876ef5b6c5fcc468335854fc6e1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b44e503e4e380522be730b11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "违反门禁时间的人，\r\n就要用富士特制的惊吓箱逗笑她……\r\n呃，这样就不能算是惩罚了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2bd6ebbe65d490bef73e6591310c5392cc6c6ca12ae70512f9c8f5a12883b4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e03751c42de5339a6fe5d26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多该是菱亚会吵着说\r\n「要赏花啦──！」的时期了吧。\r\n好，我也要提前准备我的表演项目！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f28b3e19ee33d4279f6d9544e6b6bd448986119962f69297b1281a93d931a96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f737c6a04d72432a2ac9a0b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海边虽然很好玩，但毕竟也很危险，\r\n所以也必须提醒小马驹们\r\n不要忘记注意安全才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea6a0658f87da6bdf6d960daf1fb29db87dd2f90c6f618bf5ecd7f34a1f9f484",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:729395c17c8d89fbf112e260",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了这个时期后，就会有很多来商量\r\n「不小心吃太多了～」的人。\r\n呵呵，很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "675bde2c4ba74d607550978644a4e0f2d8fe6ef6238b69d571a6650bf5217147",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d24499616303b06e38f4f45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戴手套接住雪的时候，\r\n就能用肉眼看见雪结晶。\r\n像是收到了从天而降的礼物一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd2195243b8a5a84d404598dbc64c2324567fa18a76e9270ba9658f1926c26a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adb0b870a697535ecb6e95da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "菱亚惊讶地对我说\r\n「居然不是晚礼服」。\r\n呵呵，有让你觉得惊喜吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdcc9c09cb0a1923143e64805a2a30efac5331fe0931801793796102ee390133",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d77ef291589647a4ab2a9341",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家拜托我教她们跳舞，\r\n但我一勾手臂就让她们脸红……\r\n真可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5206e6f3d3de9e791322ad74f1678dd901fee773dc8ca7044fdd427274f4742b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb4a25a2fee6c4470b7847a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有看见天空吗？\r\n我想再跟她跳一次舞。\r\n如果遇到她请帮我转达。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6169cd9fd6f6671a25acb8e207735e2bb88da2822627f0fa2f8400d3222935f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:136898276b2e8de4afcfd373",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天狼星前辈常反过来让我\r\n感到惊讶……如果能学会她的\r\n利落和强悍，感觉会很有趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abbbc4eb147d6be5e3454728d700b07935ea178a4f6ab969eed085f45a0a8601",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e11645da7e861d4abc5b9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "包含标准舞和拉丁舞在内，\r\n只要是社交舞我都会跳喔。\r\n你今天想看什么样的我？",
      "source_fingerprint": "24c84d27675142a2a7f6a0f8cfb113564ae567ec67a4576314080c886e916412",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a4a26b7caee03160321eb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我自认将服装做得很完美，\r\n但毕竟上面有很多装饰……\r\n嗯～还是再确认一次好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6bed942f531c251ae481089b34c46d0106d37ee8a6d5c5a4a50d177299ad81b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b63a2c98a254ea1cb5369911",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿这种衣服时，\r\n通常只能选方便吃的餐点。\r\n我以前在剧团很常吃饭团呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4825dec8d053af84c715a9532c4e48422f08d893c135f9eee9feb65947a45e22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5476181020e9297e0190b62e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你愿意陪我共舞一曲吗？\r\n……呵呵，开玩笑的！吓到你了吗？\r\n这样能给人完全不同的感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f32ee0b4914824ce08f5aa6c32a9e174a904aafbc714c4581839030e2c182200",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d66bbb018f47f3525aae77d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直道舞会的季节到了！\r\n在因春风而华丽起来的舞厅中，\r\n不管是谁肯定都能成为主角。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cfe2a27d147a2ff39464e4b5f4266d093cb386b625fdee5e7cb4fa642866ef0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b420c9acaff70f49e1a0ccf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到适合夏天的舞蹈，\r\n就会想到激情的桑巴或捷舞……\r\n但现在跳太热了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f519d57cdd20aac3011a9ae2f41a5b25a3fc21bd9efc4471e315e4c1e0a3ec2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af98e46186c6921e9243353",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在秋天的长夜鉴赏音乐怎么样？\r\n偶尔听一下古典乐，\r\n也很有气氛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ace0dd2b29974f04ea4ba46cdfc9574a7d1ef3970fee114e00d764234e24d68e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:293070f2c575cd0150de0868",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在雪中跳舞，白雪或许\r\n能将礼服衬托得十分鲜明。\r\n好，这就去试试看……哈啾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dc04450d35cd4c1bcae290d69da6635a5486038ef0bcd772ea66ae09aefb904",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3e317571c406b892264bdae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我希望自己无论在舞台或竞赛上，\r\n都能为人们带来乐趣。\r\n我想让他们看到耀眼的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dd03c90e438308b5f74d7dee0c9a498222a2fc9d0e51d1fcf0b396caced01f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1096dd3cf4df642335cb2d07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很漂亮吧？我当然是在说礼服。\r\n还是你觉得我本人很漂亮？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0151a6de7a895e31f1e3aa785d4381b53f46a22f8cb9a8a1b1ee2f3c2ccd6c66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3e4716bea32b6183df493bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练前的准备都已经完成了，\r\n随时都可以开始。\r\n一起度过开心的训练时间吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d49f63d89407adc5e00463b6085709c41a2a53c28e65162418887c84e4e54a97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9e33dd77e79d7d84cad268d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2121fcfc4d1d4cd54fc53b4ed95fbdd0390c59de2a5e82a334a49d1dd8b12fed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84b8e0ba287154a9183219da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小马驹们的加油声\r\n总是会带给我勇气，所以，\r\n我不希望让她们看见我难堪的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8e946d36bc1e533d8684bb74bf9a070dc32fd9d067796424906b18acf6d8c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35c665415ce88e031334231a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算不是正式的比赛，\r\n我也绝对不会松懈怠慢的。\r\n这也都是为了能让人看见「奇迹」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80dcba434650f3ad6d5df4540c529ddc09b997be1b7516c2b62687a3659011a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53648d529763e8e9a23a4a99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随着训练所累积的经验，\r\n让我感受到了自己的成长。\r\n每天都会期待明天的自己呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b0c6a4254189265c3b142f7b6d7c963a8e83fe7ec8d825420745e6093cf9a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b5e59de49c15bd4d6bdd17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我决不会白费你为了我\r\n拟定训练计划的努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a36d80215ea78af84f430bd23048ea2a3345c8f36508bf8d4f8876f8eea1d113",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1a584f495c178461b78d5af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的训练内容有很多值得学习之处，\r\n让我每天都充满惊喜，\r\n呵呵，真的很开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f034aac8190b071ad0544c5974a3e07f04a66dea515193d4efd262679a14a41e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49dd68ef9bff27c5961171ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自从你成为我的签约训练员后，\r\n增加了很多训练的乐趣。\r\n今天我们要做什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccf09a91bc54b9d4790a7d248ca42c20cd068173752bebb2041aa9801b5ae2bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2b3517a1434171a2f9ba6cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要在我的脚上种下努力的种子，\r\n并让它养成追逐竞争的习惯才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4c65523d78055e3dae55b53ef760452907fce26afe84eca64ce187a155d36ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f79c96ada708fe28456871f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我准备好啰。\r\n那么，你要带领我\r\n进行什么样的训练呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0a4d8f69ce1b3c0505a3c8a6743edb575db2914824727ab8acf0c3a43b31a9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58954a85dfbea9ff32f2ad23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使是训练也要显得华丽……\r\n并像在与人共舞般开心，\r\n我会营造出那样的时光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9f8fc0c963ddf892e83104d7ac23aa56b609911c636fa588b5f414c221e3caf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7efbb77bcf4ac5fef3ee650e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我希望能随时意识到\r\n「有人在看自己」。所以你也别将\r\n目光从我身上移开喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "87717784e9a1d44b3455a11ad76b001e5ad280080b4bec04133fe36044612e62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4555e9221f6e091128fbc8e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快步的步法或许\r\n也能应用在跑步上……？\r\n嗯～好像有点太慢了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc2a7675f72d0617935bd7ad1d01a834610ee8b1bbec3fbd927f31fecc0b013e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d955e93486b74e43a057a715",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心。\r\n我相信你能带领我\r\n到任何地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a6690b33f1e57c53e07bc0259530be5cc49748e69d5b09144041a52d2b05c2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddf90446fa36e735edb727f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也来度过快乐的时光吧！\r\n和你一起进行的训练，\r\n应该会如斗牛舞般火热吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b67747481eb9d27db29a93f062c23f5976ea9c8dafa67527fd3b83b9577bcb4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52ead413020ce4f4a3540450",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞伴的存在意义，\r\n是让彼此都变得更加闪耀……\r\n跟我和你的关系有点像呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5487d1f132994a06f800b37a6b9f1dcbf1735fc08daba04a868d2d89256c8deb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65dc490dc7e782a51a676aca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有感觉到「奇迹」吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a1a8eeb31ea822993f9d58c01ed21e56e99787f7a254a9406c6ce02a15bae4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:601c69959a5457c58344432d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "富士奇石的布幕还不会落下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bd9068b25db104c78effe2819703caa413bdafb21c5a6d296fda7f2a1425647",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bff88742b1176a65c09f44d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为最棒的搭档献上由衷的喝采。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fe4c0e5aa622777ec6246eaed075f1554fd30be5065c3aa88d60613848b7538",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5507dbcbd0b3218fc10787d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的领导非常出色喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cc95cbf1809e2fba43a0debdbc0233d39369627c714c17a12283f260b9231e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d417e872c451dbe6f648929a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要成为最棒的表演者！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d88750964833875eac823274994a2da5f872d1a375f39b3c214a0ce1d7be6b93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c02d29ab58461f3abddfb742",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还可以更闪亮耀眼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81943eaebe3e5682b2c39dd854729c5976decad6bb2cd166185ec5174865e54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adc8d7e652cbc35c9ff5abf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，我就是富士奇石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae329c3f5dffbe53437fa89c7b083ccb7f106c9983609793d9c456beca097bcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e24e587b196f95a6d2b04871",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "创造带给大家欢乐的「奇迹」吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7be00a14a9db8ca8b1582e4406db1766382cd96b6329b21c4c042045153c5b44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e7f43aacafd46b0f66b914c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是能帮上你就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c9e052017bd3dc1de59ff58f7cd0629b17f63b03b5fc338432c632e56dc733f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cc84e664b55a40f03eefd11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心的，还有我陪着你呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab0eb47799063749e63eb302e7126172fb94a614595b58ed1a0ae45429e970a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46830d8894f829a74a1f59e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的舞步变精湛了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7622bd7600f832b452a26f4e12b6a5bc905297d7a46de0fbc75df72917796f7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62256176d1a401cf1100e07d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，来跳支舞吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ead0b765d2547aa7b28571373d73b791f7478b558fef1e5c50b9e25baec3f06e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcd663feb5ae771a5a2872e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能在这座奇迹的舞台上──\r\n与你一起共舞吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "63623fa3b80f2700b4eb58dcbaa19175721ad0c4560f8bafe6b12fa814b63f16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8c401fbab1f4a62ed8bf185",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就由我富士奇石，\r\n带领你进入最棒的舞池吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fbd5352050e2cb500cc1b53a0df1ca2d3ab7b4c779052efd629dc16062b9f1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86cb518fe6b521c67f604109",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去赢得胜利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2587a7491af8ffdd491e1e1a33b946037d5d6a788f69548f5c0a648acc4bf3ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ce26abc658d443e14dd4f84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要想到还有很多\r\n比我还快的赛马娘，\r\n内心就很澎湃啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48981c7f46896911fdbb474effda24ae796bcb07d836dda1a623f21e6949bce0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e66f49045f58cd6234119e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f5d25cdb23e08e6e94409cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3c4f695a9bcc7b211959879",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛的时候，都会突然有\r\n训练员也在陪着我一起跑的感觉。\r\n……那会让我感到非常安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "577995414de66696f487fc5b6ae0282de84b067982617960ee7b8e75ae616286",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01b34725236cea2102e73e21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还想再去各处的咖啡厅坐坐呢。\r\n软绵绵的松饼……\r\n那真的好好吃……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3368efe3e654d7ab82d40ddef1d78566793ef322965c80676b480a4cabe893",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aee2de13c24754d81232efe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐，今年也麻烦你了。\r\n……所以，训练员打算吃几块年糕呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "af2717c627a9e9959b97f3bba0dc41d297bdf23d491dc97e92f22d37ae19f36f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a09f83db1783755cd3f91b95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来今天是情人节啊……\r\n会吃到怎样的巧克力呢……\r\n一整天都充满了期待呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e11f1e2d80703f65e86bd9f1b4fc996b4a57b7f808cce9ac0752c11cfb377851",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3db2b233fdc28ea609e80992",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我尝试做了巧克力。因为很认真\r\n试味道的，所以变得有点小颗……\r\n请收下吧，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b351300bc9a74a9ff39ee9852fd42bfbc298530102226ab35c1da7bd0d1525",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:160ba5697344b9cc36b8c149",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕啊……思念远方的人，\r\n那种心情我似乎能理解呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "272ff57d2961616471f5cedab6424306bd310d5078773dbb1ec0891b59a89427",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:158f36589a4fa6e25b866c95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然打算要去讨点心的话，\r\n也该事先准备好恶作剧的部分……\r\n嗯……拉袖子吓人怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "51c7cd0178c0544837729e98755e163e2b085442cc9e85df0177dff44c1bf739",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:017809a870d0f2459b5385ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我以为圣诞老人有很多个……\r\n因为家乡的大家都会扮成圣诞老人\r\n来给我礼物……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fba9ac25c220e4cfef8dd04ecddfe6b86eb07e8ed70d68e0af97506994918e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02faf1f521e47bf96d5ddc2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你喜欢土手煮吗？\r\n那是很适合欢乐夜晚的美食。\r\n我会负责做，所以希望你可以一起吃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "585e9c90f6ebf61e10f24d7132a382d9ce755d4d60b8c76c6b20ec0336f5cdc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84d893a337d24497d76b737",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d274fbb8726de6608c24a61f78c8db4bbc7d74e06bb6efd0e871dfbf618e2a0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d9104b94a76192d6a41a06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年要过完啦……真快。\r\n但我确实感觉到自己的成长。\r\n希望明年可以有更大的进步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4d36c06f436f7f597a3bbf15e44b1cc6d260725870f63c27137000727554575",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3007914890a91ccdb907e6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。\r\n商店街有一家蛋糕很好吃的店哦。\r\n要不要一起去呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba44142701182a2813de79846927c2e41e0c7c56e0010b162513ad2bdbd9586b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f34c897cd1354ce8720d93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，祝你生日快乐。\r\n呵呵……真奇怪，\r\n怎么连我也跟着开心了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a93e1f5721ec48fbeb06e4a62840e69f63fb01680f624e378d498c2bef69c1f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:113abbd14a8e0ca3987f011b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有很多朋友一起帮我庆生……\r\n虽然是很开心的事情，\r\n但却觉得有点不好意思呢……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93f7d87c209675d5ab240900941ae782a15beafa3ec86c60e8934c0d515117b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed513f80fd4a4b662bd17c66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也是来祝贺的吗？我很开心哦。\r\n……真奇怪，我怎么好像刚蒸好的\r\n馒头一样，整个人热呼呼的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa18acccb832246d773fa6d564e6bdd05be9e2806e7508d3d0f05b5a26ae16c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8769309f6eba6c2fbf7e4ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到新的公告了。\r\n是不是确认一下比较好？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e12c8637fa9f75b59ae1b2df64f04e19ac909bb5b7ad0c0d7cfb8b104770e8c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:159111dca60d044b7d21279e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到礼物了。\r\n会是吃的吗……可不能让它坏掉，\r\n快点打开吧，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28a56772df8ecb843752a4046d06a677a609c11bc5d30ee8bbdaa24e27b14955",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d811f177fed0c96fe06fca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有任务达成了。\r\n真厉害，我也要好好努力才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba9d9c0ea1c0cdc66056284650ea9cbf95aac79be60bdec3561be5392647ba60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3543b2b5715b8f214c8e5b88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像快要举办活动了。\r\n觉得心里有点躁动呢……嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fb8053ecca83f2f09bcbf275dcc4b651cd2efa10fa0dc14e640db76afa0ddfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10018"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
